<title>POLAND: Gerling gets insurance licence in Poland.</title>
<headline>Gerling gets insurance licence in Poland.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Polish Finance Ministry has granted a life insurance operation licence to  ATU-Gerling, controlled by German insurer Gerling Konzern Versicherungs, the Polish firm said on Thursday.</p>
<p>PAP quoted ATU spokeswoman Grazyna Kaminska as saying that the company, in which Gerling has a 75-percent stake and six Polish firms the rest, would be registered in court next week and then promptly launch operations.</p>
<p>ATU-Gerling's capital of ten million zlotys is divided into 100,000 shares.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
